  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Let <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is the slope of the tangent to the curve, then,&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></math><br /><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0010_e3ec54021417.jpeg\" /><br /><br />So it is minima at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math>"
